TITLE  uniform flow field - dedolomitization



SOLUTION 1  inflow solution

        units   mol/l

        pH         3.0

        Ca         4.152e-3

        Cl         2.401e-4

        Na         9.906e-5

        Mg         7.124e-5

        C(4)       5.503e-5

        S(6)       4.836e-3   charge



SOLUTION 2  initial solution

        units   mol/l

        pH         7.966

        Ca         1.188e-3

        Mg         8.848e-4

        Na         1e-4

        S(6)       8.502e-4

        C(4)       1.113e-3

        Cl         1.442e-3   charge

END



USE solution 2



EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 2

    Calcite         0.0        0.0

    Dolomite        0.0     10.303



SAVE solution 2



END



SELECTED_OUTPUT

        -file dedo.sel

        -reset false

USER_PUNCH

-headings Ca Mg C(4) S(6) Calcite Dolomite SI_calcite SI_dolomite

10 PUNCH TOT("Ca"), TOT("Mg"), TOT("C(4)"), TOT("S(6)")

20 vf_calcite = EQUI("Calcite")*0.3/1000*100.0894/2.71

30 vf_dolomite = EQUI("Dolomite")*0.3/1000*184.410/2.85

40 PUNCH vf_calcite vf_dolomite

50 PUNCH SI("Calcite") SI("Dolomite")



END

